"from Replicate with natural language prompts. Choose from multiple models "
"including Flux 2 Pro, GPT Image 1.5, GPT Image 2, GPT Image 2.5 Sunburst, "
"Grok Imagine Image 2, Imagen 4, Nano Banana, Nano Banana 2, Nano Banana Pro, "
"Qwen Image 2 Pro, Qwen Image Edit 2511, Seedream 5 Pro, and Stable Diffusion "
"3.5 Large Turbo."
